(Change process:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Propose inference rule/model change.) Tj
T*
(2. Identify affected capabilities, evidence types, graph paths, and products.) Tj
T*
(3. Run regression and fairness tests.) Tj
T*
(4. Review with Ontology, Graph, Reasoning, Security/Privacy, and domain owners.) Tj
T*
(5. Dual-run against prior version where high-impact.) Tj
T*
(6. Publish versioned release notes and migration/replay plan.) Tj
T*
(7. Monitor drift, appeals, and outcome quality.) Tj
