() Tj
T*
(18. Final Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(INF-001 establishes how Syrka infers human capability. Capabilities are never declared by users,) Tj
T*
( courses, LMSs, credentials, or AI models alone. They emerge through evidence-backed, ontology-) Tj
T*
(grounded, graph-aware, confidence-scored, reviewable, reproducible inference.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This constitution governs capability inference, learning recommendations, career intelligence, ) Tj
T*
(employer matching, workforce planning, government analytics, and Job Passport generation. Every ) Tj
T*
(capability can be challenged, reviewed, strengthened, weakened, transferred, decayed, or revoked) Tj
T*
( while preserving historical provenance and independence from any AI provider or LMS ) Tj
T*
(implementation.) Tj
